  "bio": "Step into the vibrant world of Unda Kova Tattoo Studio, nestled in the heart of Las Vegas at 5137 E. Owens Ave., where creativity and ink flow endlessly. Specializing in bold newschool, elegant lettering, and captivating neotraditional designs, our artists transform your visions into stunning body art in an environment that’s as welcoming as it is inspiring. Join us for an unforgettable embellishment of self-expression crafted right on the canvas of your skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Las Vegas, Nevada, United States"
